+issueNumber: MDL-89346
+notes:
+  mod_assign:
+    - message: >-
+        The `mod_assign_get_submission_status` web service now returns a new
+        `markerfeedback` field (in `feedback` and in each of the
+        `previousattempts`) containing the feedback given by each individual
+        marker in assignments using multiple markers.
+      type: changed
+    - message: >-
+        A new `get_marker_file_areas()` method has been added to the
+        `assign_feedback_plugin` base class. Feedback plugins storing files for
+        individual markers (using the `assign_mark` id as item id) should
+        override it to return those file areas.
+      type: added
